      "note": "Montagny produces white Chardonnay wines only. Its full production area spans Montagny-lès-Buxy, Buxy, Jully-lès-Buxy and Saint-Vallerin. Named village lieux-dits and individual producer holdings are not mapped separately."
    },
    "inao-denom-886": {
